# API routes

## Layout

```
src/app/api/<resource>/
  route.ts       # GET/POST handlers
  schema.ts      # Zod schemas (request/response)
  store.ts       # Data access (optional)
  __tests__/     # Schema and handler tests
```

## Handler pattern

- Validate input with Zod; return `400` with a clear message on failure
- Use domain enums from `@/domain/*` for status values — do not hardcode strings
- Auth: reuse helpers from `@/app/api/auth/helpers` (e.g. `requireAuth`)
- Log errors with `logError({ message, error, module: LogModule.API, context })`
- Return `NextResponse.json(...)` with appropriate status codes

## Tests

- Colocate tests in `__tests__/` next to the route
- Test schema validation and edge cases; mock external I/O in handler tests
